<Information title="About" description="Almir Sarajčić, Elixir and Phoenix consultant and founder of Optimum Tech.">
  <p>I’m Almir Sarajčić, a software consultant and founder of <a href="https://optimum.ba/">Optimum Tech</a>. I help teams build and improve Elixir and Phoenix applications, add AI features, and improve their development workflows.</p>
  <p>I’ve worked in software since 2012 and on professional Elixir projects since 2017. My work includes taking products from proof of concept into production, improving existing applications, and building the checks and tooling around delivery.</p>
  <p>I’m based in Kenya (UTC+3) and work in Bosnian and English. You can explore my <a href="/#building">products</a>, <a href="/#history">work history</a> and <a href="/Almir_Sarajcic_CV.pdf">CV (PDF)</a>, or <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a> about your project.</p>
